<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<body class="portal-legal-body">
  <header class="portal-legal-header">
    <a href="/login" class="portal-legal-brand" aria-label="Findoly provider login">
      <img src="/images/findoly-logo.png" alt="Findoly">
      <span>Provider portal</span>
    </a>
    <a class="btn btn-light btn-sm" href="/login">Provider login</a>
  </header>

  <main class="portal-legal-shell">
    <article class="card portal-legal-card">
      <div class="card-body">
        <span class="portal-legal-kicker">Findoly Solutions LLP</span>
        <h1>Shipping and Service Delivery Policy</h1>
        <p class="portal-legal-lead">Findoly provides digital subscription and credit services; no physical shipping applies.</p>
        <p class="portal-legal-effective">Effective date: 29 July 2026</p>
        <div class="portal-legal-content">

<section>
  <h2>1. No physical delivery</h2>
  <p>Findoly does not sell or ship physical goods through the Provider Portal. Shipping charges, courier delivery and physical tracking numbers do not apply.</p>
</section>
<section>
  <h2>2. Digital service activation</h2>
  <p>Purchased digital credits or subscription access are activated in the registered provider account after the payment has been successfully verified by Findoly and the payment gateway.</p>
</section>
<section>
  <h2>3. Delivery confirmation</h2>
  <p>Activated credits and plan information are shown in the Credits section of the Provider Portal. Payment and credit activity remain available in the relevant account records.</p>
</section>
<section>
  <h2>4. Delayed verification</h2>
  <p>Activation may remain pending when the payment gateway, bank or network has not provided a final verified status. Do not make repeated payments for the same purchase while an earlier transaction is still pending.</p>
</section>
<section>
  <h2>5. Reporting a delivery issue</h2>
  <p>If a verified payment is not reflected in the account, email <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a> with the registered provider mobile number, payment date, amount and payment reference so the transaction can be investigated.</p>
</section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <section class="portal-legal-navigation" aria-label="Policies and support">
      <strong>Policies and support</strong>
      <%- include('../partials/policy-links', { policyLinksClass: 'portal-policy-links' }) %>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="portal-legal-page-footer">
    <span>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> <%= legalEntityName %></span>
    <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
